  "description": "532-entry roster foundation of the Afro American Encyclopedia of Sports, built against the adopted blueprint CTL-SPT-ENC v1.0 (36 sports, target 1,212 — a target, not a count; gap 682). Pre-scour roster v2 (2026-10-29) held 522 entries; a Drive-wide scour on 2026-11-16 added 10 verified entries (7 from the CTL Sports Firsts package, incl. John Matthew Shippen Jr., George Poage and William DeHart Hubbard; 3 KG333/AEO-500 crossovers, incl. Coco Gauff, Sha'Carri Richardson and Noah Lyles) and annexed 54 further verified finds with reasons. Status (verbatim ladder): roster 463, stub 69, full 0, published 0. Baseball, Basketball, Football and Boxing stand exactly at blueprint target. One added first is Disputed (Tia Norfleet — the row records the person and the dispute, never the claim as fact) and one Provisional (Rajo Jack).",
